sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Estimate an item
    %% Stories: 5, 30, 32, 34, 41
    %% Description: The moderator selects an item, the estimators play a card and can change it until the estimates are shown. Everyone sees who has already estimated.
    actor M as Moderator
    actor EP as Estimator (person)
    actor PT as Participant
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item
    participant E as Estimator
    participant ES as Estimate

    %% covers 5
    M->>R: select item to estimate
    %% covers 30
    R->>I: item to estimate
    EP->>E: play a card
    E->>ES: estimate
    ES->>I: estimate for the item
    %% covers 32
    PT->>R: see who has already estimated
    %% covers 34, 41
    EP->>E: change card before the reveal
    E->>ES: changed estimate
